&lt;tr style="mso-height-source: userset; height: 116.25pt;"&gt;
&lt;td class="xl66" style="height: 116.25pt; width: 535pt;" colspan="5" width="714" height="154"&gt;Please refer to the "Notes to Financial Statements" included in the 2025 Annual FERC Form 2-A of Granite State Gas Transmission, Inc., which begin on page 123.1 of that report.&amp;#160; Also, please refer to the Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements of the 2025 Form 10-K of Unitil Corporation and the Form 10-Q of Unitil Corporation for the period ended March 31, 2026 as filed with the United States Securities and Exchange Commission.&amp;#160;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
