    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH678861B982A07CAF854767A904BD0BE3" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Rate schedule LMS and OBA provide for all volumetric imbalances to be resolved in-kind with delivery point operator. Thus, a value for this volume is not assigned on pages 521c and d.</p>
      </div>
